<title>POLAND: Polish Mieszko raises IPO price to PLN 13.</title>
<headline>Polish Mieszko raises IPO price to PLN 13.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				   confectioner Mieszko SA</p>
<p> Type of issue:			  new common shares</p>
<p> Priced at (PLN):			13</p>
<p> Previous price:			 10</p>
<p> No of Shares Offered:		 1.5 million</p>
<p> No of Existing Shares:		4.2 million</p>
<p> Lead Manager:			   Amerbrokers</p>
<p> Lead Underwriters:		    MC Concordia Sp z o o</p>
<p>					     MC BBL Securities Ltd</p>
<p>Use Of Proceeds: capacity, distribution network expansion</p>
<p> Tranches		     No of Shares	   Subscription</p>
<p>				  Offered		  Period</p>
<p> Open			   1.45 million		 April 14-18</p>
<p> Employees and management 50,000		   April 7-11</p>
<p> Earnings Data (million PLN)  1997 forecast	  1996</p>
<p> Net profit:		   7.1		     4.1</p>
<p> Sales:			 70.0		    46.7</p>
<p>Przedsiebiorstwo Wielobranzowe Expand holds 37.3 pct of shares of Mieszko, which seeks a parallel market listing.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
